# Meta pills (topic, status, hero labels)

Pill labels in **page heroes and card headers** — topic chips (`Citations`),
status chips (`Opportunity`, `Winning`), and similar meta tags — use
**14px** text.

## Spec

```
inline-flex items-center
px-2.5 py-1
rounded-full
text-[14px] font-medium
border …
```

Never `text-[12px]` or `text-[13px]` on these.

## Examples

- Prompt detail hero: topic + status next to “Last 30 days”
- AI Search Performance prompt detail hero
- Other non-table topic / status label chips with the same chrome

## Not this rule

Table-cell status tags (HTTP codes, Yes/No, overlap Watch/Stable, engine
count badges) stay on the **12px** badge floor — those are denser data tags,
not hero meta pills.
